---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Facts from '../components/Facts.astro';
import FishingImage from '../assets/fishing.jpeg';
---
<Base title="About" wide>
  <section class="container about-intro g12">
    <Image class="about-photo" src={FishingImage} alt="Tyler fishing" width={600} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">/about</p>
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="about-lead"><strong>Hi, I’m Tyler Evans — in case the URL didn’t give it away.</strong></p>
      <p>I’m a husband to my amazing wife, a proud father of three wild and wonderful boys, and a guy who’s really good at turning caffeine into code. When I’m not behind a screen, you’ll find me somewhere outside: camping, hiking, riding ATVs, hunting, fishing, gardening, or competing in handgun shooting matches.</p>
      <p>I’ve been building software professionally for over a decade. I started my career as a full-stack developer at a small insurance company using .NET. From there, I spent several years contracting with a variety of great companies and teams, helping build some truly awesome applications. These days, I’m a Staff Engineer at <strong>O.C. Tanner</strong> — an incredible employee recognition company that actually <i>practices what it preaches</i>.</p>
      <p>Outside of work, I’m a maker at heart. I love building with my hands, especially in the woodshop or out in the yard. Lately I’ve been hooked on fishing — few things are more peaceful than casting a line into a lake or river with no cell service in sight.</p>
      <p>I’m passionate about learning, growing, and pushing myself — whether that’s leveling up my engineering skills or chasing tighter groups in competition shooting. I love exploring my “own backyard” here in Utah, and I rarely turn down a chance to get outside with family or friends.</p>
      <p>Thanks for stopping by — feel free to poke around, check out my projects, or drop me a message!</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Facts />
  <section class="container off-clock" aria-labelledby="off-clock-title">
    <div class="section-head"><h2 id="off-clock-title">Off the clock</h2><a href="/writing">all writing →</a></div>
    <div class="off-clock-topics g12">
      <article><h3>Woodworking</h3><p>I love building with my hands, especially in the woodshop or out in the yard.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Fishing</h3><p>Lately I’ve been hooked on fishing — few things are more peaceful than casting a line into a lake or river with no cell service in sight.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
